  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Going to Michigan**: back after 152 archived shows (3661 days); rare: 4 archived performances [2]\n- **The Water Song**: back after 156 archived shows (3828 days); rare: 5 archived performances [2]\n- **Riches and Wonders**: back after 71 archived shows (1136 days); rare: 7 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **tmg2019-12-07** (recommended): source not stated; 18 songs; 78 min [1]. Said about its sound: Uploader says the second Haw River night came out decent, unlike the first night's attempt, which turned out poorly [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Both 2019 Haw River shows were recorded; the first night's recording was worse, and its solo set might be added later [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **tmg2019-12-07**: taped by Jamesbers [1]",
